{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21056","headline":"听颖师琴歌 · 李贺","name":"听颖师琴歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别浦云归桂花渚，蜀国弦中双凤语。\n芙蓉叶落秋鸾离，越王夜起游天姥。\n暗佩清臣敲水玉，渡海蛾眉牵白鹿。\n谁看挟劒赴长桥，谁看浸发题春竹。\n竺僧前立当吾门，梵宫真相眉棱尊。\n古琴大轸长八尺，峄阳老树非桐孙。\n凉馆闻弦惊病客，药囊暂别龙须席。\n请歌直请卿相歌，奉礼官卑复何益。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}